{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kl3574/Learning_Workbench/pulls/53","id":4597686222,"node_id":"PR_kwDOUaKq7M8AAAABEgsfzg","html_url":"https://github.com/kl3574/Learning_Workbench/pull/53","diff_url":"https://github.com/kl3574/Learning_Workbench/pull/53.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/kl3574/Learning_Workbench/pull/53.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kl3574/Learning_Workbench/issues/53","number":53,"state":"open","locked":false,"title":"[M6.1] Add consent-bound worked-example drafts and independent numeric checks","user":{"login":"kl3574","id":31810429,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMxODEwNDI5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/31810429?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kl3574","html_url":"https://github.com/kl3574","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kl3574/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kl3574/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kl3574/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kl3574/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kl3574/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kl3574/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kl3574/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kl3574/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kl3574/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"作者此前无法在明确授权前准备一个真实例题任务，也无法把模型草稿与单独批准的数值检查分开。本变更建立同一 Job 的准备、Provider 预览/批准、受检原输出和不可变候选；数值检查另行预览、批准或拒绝，草稿保持未发布、未审核。角色或策略限制学科内容时仍可访问安全任务列表并取消。\n\n- task_id / Issue：M6.1，关联 #30；这是 §20.8 首个 `worked_example` 切片，不关闭整个 M6.1。基于仍待审的 #52；旧 Tutor CI 失败继续保留，不能用本轮本地通过认定历史原因已修复。\n- 规范：3.0.6 / `30220c34fe7312887f5bcb1c67406c9638f1719ff3ed7bc9e95d7d5085b5d924`。54 core、0001 DDL 和学习包版本不变；迁移 0014 新增 Authoring 候选、实际批准身份、数值执行和命令账本。\n- 实现：7 个严格具名 HTTP 操作、75 个契约生成产物，真实 SQLite/Jobs/Provider source 与后台 worker，独立数值预览/拒绝/批准，前端原命令恢复、学科权限清理和安全取消。Import 草稿保持原 owner；无审核发布或 Codex 假接口。\n- 固定源码：`80986eaed01d4de620cdd4320a7fab8ce01ce959`。完整 Python 1,927 PASS / 1 ENVIRONMENT SKIP（396.73s，2 条依赖弃用警告）；Web 401 PASS / 72 文件；完整浏览器 96 PASS（8.3m）。Ruff、Mypy 162 文件、Web lint/typecheck/build、规范生成检查均实际通过。构建大 chunk 提示保留。\n- 输入证据：903 个非 progress 文件逐 Git blob/mode 绑定；前八门禁执行前后相同。浏览器只改变四张既有直接输出 PNG，44 份前后原件均保全，再按精确 hash 守卫恢复；原 `unchanged=false` 和恢复回执同时保留。\n- 修复证据：后端原输出关联、批准会话、撤回后重新批准、权限恢复读取；UI 安全入口、迟到工作区读回、关闭状态 render 循环与 390px 内部溢出均保留原反例和修后结果。实际 1440/390 截图显示原创合成草稿及数值 `BLOCKED`。\n- 脱敏证据：`progress/evidence/2026-09-16/M6.1-*`、`progress/evidence/2026-09-22/M6.1-final-gates`；原始字节 SHA、公开派生字节 SHA、变换与输入映射可回读。仅公开原创代码、合成内容和受检工程记录，不包含用户密钥、数据库、会话或个人教材。\n- 实阻塞：封存 bubblewrap 在此主机被 AppArmor 拒绝，数值真实结果为 `environment_unavailable / BLOCKED`；没有成功隔离计算、运行取消及资源限制验收，跳过不算成功。生产 InputProof 仍为空，平台 DeepSeek、真实搜索、数学/来源/教学效果均未验收；本变更没有新增真实供应商调用。\n- 下一任务：继续 M6.1 小节/习题集/测验生成所需的本地题面—私解检查与具名候选契约；另行闭合隔离环境和托管输入证明。M6.2 审核发布、M6.3 Codex 保持未实现。\n\n本 PR 保持 draft，供审查；不自动合并，不关闭 Issue。当前远端 CI 状态须以实际运行回读为准，不由本地门禁推定。\n","created_at":"2026-09-22T01:45:19Z","updated_at":"2026-09-22T01:45:19Z","closed_at":null,"merged_at":null,"merge_commit_sha":"a08bb873d8e85192e8a8938545ae96cdc2ed28b6","assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"labels":[],"milestone":null,"draft":true,"commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kl3574/Learning_Workbench/pulls/53/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kl3574/Learning_Workbench/pulls/53/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kl3574/Learning_Workbench/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kl3574/Learning_Workbench/issues/53/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kl3574/Learning_Workbench/statuses/79908fb941898eb2b515719ce175c68dde3c71ef","head":{"label":"kl3574:feat/M6.1-worked-example","ref":"feat/M6.1-worked-example","sha":"79908fb941898eb2b515719ce175c68dde3c71ef","user":{"login":"kl3574","id":31810429,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMxODEwNDI5","avata